<title>SWEDEN: Sintercast says Hagman resigns from FIBA. [CORRECTED 13:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sintercast says Hagman resigns from FIBA. [CORRECTED 13:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish development company Sintercast said on Friday Bertil Hagman had retired from the boards of stockbrokers FIBA Nordic Securities (UK) Ltd and FIBA Nordic Securities AB. (Corrects to show Hagman has not also resigned from Sintercast's board.)</p>
</text>
